// slice is never mutated. Resolution is inherit-then-override per plugin:
// absent rows inherit the config Enabled; a module-scope row (LibraryID 0)
// applies to every library; a library's OWN row replaces the module-scope row
// for that library. Effective enabled is binding.Enabled AND the effective
// row's Enabled, so a gate can only mute a config-enabled source — it never
// revives a disabled one. prefs is the caller's batched per-module read
// (store.ListMetadataSourcePrefs: module-scope rows + this library's rows);
// rows for other modules or other libraries are ignored. Pure and deps-free:
// the derivation, drain, and settle passes share ONE resolution per (pass,
